      "finding": "discussion_r4496756199",
      "area": "server/publish/service.ts and artifacts.ts",
      "implementation": "Failed jobs release only unused byte reservations; retained on-disk files remain charged. Building reservations and published bytes remain accounted. The durable attempt-count abuse limit is intentionally retained; retention/cleanup is still an operational gate. Owner-row and claim/state fencing prevent stale workers from writing after terminal completion.",
